# Every file in this tree is covered by CHECKSUMS.sha256, and the 581 diffs under
# data/pools/*/diffs/ are hashed again inside each pool.json and inside the frozen
# task tree hash. Any end-of-line conversion changes those bytes, so a checkout on
# a machine with core.autocrlf=true would fail the artifact's own verification
# through no fault of the person running it.
#
# Turning text conversion off for everything is therefore not a style choice: it
# is what makes `bulkpr verify` and `bulkpr build` give the same answer on Linux,
# macOS and Windows.
* -text
